{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12233120","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12233120","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1223312001:0":{"text":"그렇게 노려보지 마. 새롭게 일을 시작했으니까 당분간은 사고 안 칠 거야!","source_cn":"别瞪老子，老子现在有了新工作，暂时没有打砸抢了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF82C0C8D086344DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1223312002:0":{"text":"이봐, 세실. 당분간이라는 말은 빼!","source_cn":"喂，西索，别强调暂时！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5103BC61E866E58E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1223312003:0":{"text":"됐다, 다들 가만히 있어.","source_cn":"得了，别搞小动作了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD795240AC5B238E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1223312004:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 왜 이 녀석들과 함께 계십니까?","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7B76F85C255EB40E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 왜 이 녀석들과 함께 계십니까?","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 왜 이 녀석들과 함께 계십니까?","variant_male_record_index":"140100","variant_female_record_index":"140101","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1223312004":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 왜 이 녀석들과 함께 계십니까?","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name></style>，你为